{"change_summary":"Revalidated the review-flagged shrimp reproduction budget path and found that the reported hatch-accounting leak does not reproduce on the current branch, so this apply-fixes pass did not require additional code edits. The closed-system reproduction budget regression, the dedicated molt/mineral suite, and the downstream `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` suites all pass; the only remaining broader-suite failure is the unrelated pre-existing `thermal_reproduction_penalty` test.","outstanding_risks":["`cargo test -p tank_core` still fails in `crates/tank_core/tests/thermal_reproduction_penalty.rs`; that regression appears unrelated to this molt/mineral task and was not changed in this pass."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the review-flagged shrimp reproduction budget path and reran the closed-system budget regressions to verify whether the reported hatching-accounting leak still reproduced on the current branch.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Revalidated the molt/mineral coverage and downstream package suites against the current branch; all targeted regressions passed without requiring further code edits.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran a broader `tank_core` sweep to capture remaining suite state and confirmed that the only outstanding failure is the pre-existing unrelated `thermal_reproduction_penalty` regression.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test thermal_reproduction_penalty -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core`","`cargo test -p tank_data`","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios`"]}